  "ingredients": [
    "1 teaspoon white sugar",
    "1 tablespoon active dry yeast",
    "3 cups warm water (110 degrees F/45 degrees C)",
    "7 cups all-purpose flour, divided, or as needed",
    "1 tablespoon salt",
    "cooking spray"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/6ybZoKigzocHgVPDvIzGXGFvwEA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/6955_MamaDsItalianBreadRecipe_ddmfs_4x3_step1_gw_0247-c017223af2bc4e47909a9e072e38dfa7.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/6955/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add sugar and yeast to the warm water and let proof.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/wIKXX8cbvy6rMvFRfLzwbQjHPHI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/6955_MamaDsItalianBreadRecipe_ddmfs_4x3_step2_gw_0251-4691a26a7a6d4a468ebb06e12d0e0c6d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/6955/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir in 4 cups flour and beat until smooth. Cover and let rest for 15 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/XGJ2nLOnpWscghbhsAr6Bwodr20=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/6955_MamaDsItalianBreadRecipe_ddmfs_4x3_step3_gw_0259-23e59bafb14544a7a49568d3350b84c3.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/6955/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Beat in salt and then add enough remaining flour to make a stiff dough. Knead until soft and smooth. Turn in a greased bowl, cover, and let rise until doubled in size.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/uuAXcxdhUgESxUy4KlUWAw7aDgQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/6955_MamaDsItalianBreadRecipe_ddmfs_4x3_step4_gw_0343-918b37d34b5542b686d3c6fc8e0d9807.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/6955/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Once doubled, punch down and divide into three. Place back in the bowl, cover, and let rise again.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/d0wgpN1AU8E1EFKd1Uy-6g9AMZE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/6955_MamaDsItalianBreadRecipe_ddmfs_4x3_step5_gw_0345-d5b09a1fd7234910bc79423c94911181.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/6955/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Once doubled, punch down and form into three fat “footballs.” Grease heavy cookie sheets and sprinkle with cornmeal. Place the bread on the sheets, cover with a towel, and let rise.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/GUR7jsjorvC_Bo7PKqGuEkwUI5A=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/6955_MamaDsItalianBreadRecipe_ddmfs_4x3_step6-1_gw_0350-a1b8b9cd1eb44c43a595ff2fa5ca44ad.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/6955/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 450 degrees F (230 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Mist loaves with water and place in the preheated oven.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/JS1UFB9Sr1M9-McpfIgR9XgngKM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/6955_MamaDsItalianBreadRecipe_ddmfs_4x3_step7_gw_0371-530c05809db84632b567f26d916e18e9.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/6955/step_08.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake until loaves are golden brown and sound hollow when tapped on the bottom, 25 to 30 minutes. Mist loaves with water and turn occasionally while they bake.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Cpt_frRLu1_t_8HGzW_pss7IlFI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/6955_MamaDsItalianBreadRecipe_ddmfs_4x3_step8_gw_0477-5854e88f4a754d4f8b1a6765208c62a5.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/6955/step_09.webp"
    }
  ],
